DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nYou are welcome to join me on a 40 km sce
 nic bike ride in halton hills.\n\n* Here's the route [https://ridewithgps.
 com/routes/34336389](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/34336389)\n* There wil
 l be many hills. But very scenic downhills too\n* You are welcome to bring
  any bike\, provided you can maintain a \\~20 - 22 kph pace over 40km and 
